     <p style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2026年绍兴一中高校招生体检工作方案</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 22pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">  </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">普通高校招生体检工作是高校招生工作的一个重要环节，是维护广大考生合法权益和向高校输送合格人才的一项重要工作。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我校的</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高校招生体检工作</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">将于</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">月17日和18日进行，根据绍兴市教育考试院高校招生</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">体检工作会议</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">精神，结合我校实际，特制定以下</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高三</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全面</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">体检工作</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">方案。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>一、体检工作领导小组</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">组 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">长：蒋  明</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">副组长：冯王亮</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">组 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">员：</span><a style="text-decoration: none;"></a><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">祝智浩 马作菁  汪陈帅  张帆 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">余栋材 赵正瑜</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">范国娟</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> 高三班主任</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>二、体检组织工作</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（一）体检资料准备与发放和培训</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">负责人：马作菁 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">汪陈帅 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">根据要求打印整理引导单、体检表、条形码、身份标识等，按时发放回收。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">召开班主任会议，发体检相关事项告家长书。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（二）体检交通安排</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">祝智浩 马作菁 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">张帆  余栋材 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">汪陈帅  赵正瑜</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">联系汽运公司租借大巴车3辆，交通工具必须符合有关要求，签订有关合同，要求一个班级一辆车，做好应急预案。具体班级乘坐车辆如下：</span></p><table style="border: none;border-collapse: collapse;margin-bottom: .001pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0.40in;" class="firstRow"><td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 42.3pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">时间</span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left-style: none;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 56.7pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">批次</span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left-style: none;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 42.5pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">出发时间</span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left-style: none;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 35.45pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-al