rder-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 21.8pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">33</span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left-style: none;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 21.8pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7</span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left-style: none;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 41.8pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">40</span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left-style: none;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 47.55pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">沈栋啸</span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left-style: none;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 72pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">15381666576</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">所有本校在读学生必须从学校出发。发车前1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">0</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">分钟准时到达</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;"><strong>东门上车</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">地点，由班主任点名后按规定车号依次上车。上车后在固定位置就座，不在车内随意走动。到达体检站后依次下车，经由固定通道进入体检站参加体检，期间服从工作人员指挥。体检结束后乘原车返回，在</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;"><strong>北门下车</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">后进校 。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（三）体检领队</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">带队领导：冯王亮</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">带队医务和领队老师：范国娟   马作菁   祝智浩</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">带队领导和医务人员在上午7:</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">30</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">之前，下午12:3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">0</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">之前到达体检站（绍兴文理学院附属医院体检站，中兴南路999号），负责体检管理、处理突发事件。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高三各班领队：各班班主任</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各班班主任需跟随本班学生共同行动，同车往返。负责本班学生点名、现场紧急情况处理等事宜。如有请假学生及时与马作菁联系。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>班主任统一带好本班学生的身份标识、体检引导单和血检条形码，上车后发给学生，体检引导单体检过程中使用，体检后学生统一交给班主任。血检条形码抽血时贴在试管上。</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（四）体检要求</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>1．交通安全</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.30in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（1）各班学生必须随车跟带队班主任统一行动，往返均应乘学校安排的大巴车，上车前班主任要负责清点本班学生数。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.30in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（2）有序上车，来回座位固定，车内保持安静，以免影响体检数据。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2．体检纪律</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在体检场内保持安静，不得大声喧哗，听从引导人员指挥，不要跑动，以免血压、心率异常（血压以当天检查为准，不得复检）。体检过程中途不得离开，如有急事需要离开，须报告班主任和带队校医。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.37in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: -0.08in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>3．其他事项</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.30in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（1）有关体检情况由考试院转交学校统一发放。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.30in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（2）实事求是，不得冒名顶替，一经发现严肃处理。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.30in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）戴好口罩，搞好个人卫生（洗脚、洗澡、内衣裤整洁），统一穿校服。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.30in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>4</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>）禁止带手机、零食、贵重物品、书本，不要戴金属制品。</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.30in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）住院做过手术留有明显疤痕的要带上医院的手术证明（阑尾炎手术除外），体检时医生如果需要查验，请出示。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.30in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>体检时如果对检查结果有异议，应该及时提出再次检查申请或让带队领导和校医转达申请（不要出体检站）。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.30in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）放弃体检的考生向学校提出，由学校汇总，报体检站；如遇特殊情况不能按时体检的学生，须提前1天提出书面申请，经学校批准后方可延期体检，但不能晚于</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">月19日；对外科体检有特殊要求的学生，可在体检前提出申请，并家长签名，经学校审核，报体检站安排单独外科体检，无正当理由不得单独外科体检。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>8</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>）</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>不能戴隐形眼镜</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>，</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">可以带边框眼镜。佩戴助听器的学生在检查时要事先和医生说明情况。色觉检查不能戴眼镜。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><a style="text-decoration: none;"></a><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">9</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）体检期间服从体检站工作人员引导安排。体检</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>全程须带好口罩</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">并注意做好个人防护做到安全体检、文明体检、有序体检。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（1</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>0</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>）</strong></span><a style="text-decoration: none;"></a><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>有关上课安排：当天体检的班级体育课改自修，轮到体检的班级体检这半天的课改自修。不参加体检的班级按课表上课，带队班主任的课改自修。冲掉的课任课老师可视情况自行调到空缺的地方补上。 </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）体检主检单位地址：绍兴文理学院附属医院（中兴南路999号）。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（五）体检结果反馈及复检安排</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全部体检结束2天后，由学校将体检结论反馈单放给学生确认，对其中结果有疑问的学生，可于3月20日之前提出复检（ALT和血压除外），学校统一提交市考试院。复检日期初定3月25日上午，地点同体检地点。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中教学处           </span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">20</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6年3月5日</span></p>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
